    "sentence_translations": [
      "The sound of a man snoring",
      "",
      "He had been out on a business trip and came back a day in advance.",
      "It had already gotten very late when he returned home.",
      "Originally he’d wanted to give her a pleasant surprise.",
      "But when walked up to the bedroom door, he however heard the sound of a man snoring come from inside.",
      "He opened the door to go in with a puzzled look on his face, only to find her sleeping soundly holding her phone.",
      "Bursting sounds of snoring came from the phone; it was the sound of him snoring.",
      "It turned out that it was a recording that she had made when he was snoring.",
      "",
      "Maybe, if you love someone for a long time, you get used to everything about them after a while.",
      ""
    ]
  }
